Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Let the owner switch stereo-to-rear off and on

The owner needs to compare stereo-to-rear with plain stereo, and to go
back to plain stereo without reinstalling. A "Stereo to rear speakers"
switch, on by default, sits first in the player's playback settings,
where a change restarts the video to apply it, and beside the audio
delay in the player settings.
